==Middle Welsh==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|wlm|cel-pro|*aramo-||quiet}}, from {{inh|wlm|ine-pro|*h₁r̥h₃-mo-}}, from {{der|wlm|ine-pro|*h₁reh₃-|t=rest}}. Cognate with {{cog|sa|ईरमा|tr=īrmā́|t=to keep still}}, {{m|sa|रात्री|t=night}}, {{cog|grc|ἐρωή|t=rest}}, {{cog|de|Ruhe|t=rest}}.<ref>{{R:cel:Zair:2012|page=44}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|wlm|/ˈarav/}}

===Adjective===
{{head|wlm|adjective}}

# [[slow]], [[leisurely]]

====Derived terms====
* {{l|wlm|araueð||slowness}}

====Descendants====
